WEBVTT

00:08:28.960 --> 00:08:32.640
The day of his wake
there is a transit strike.

00:08:34.039 --> 00:08:40.176
Jen walks from Cobble Hill
to Crown Heights

00:08:40.200 --> 00:08:41.720
so she can go with me.

00:08:42.600 --> 00:08:46.416
There are moments that bond,
and this one is key.

00:08:46.440 --> 00:08:51.176
When there is no train,
no car service, no bus,

00:08:51.200 --> 00:08:56.440
my sister will walk miles
just to be by my side.

00:08:57.600 --> 00:09:01.120
JM: When a sister loves a sister.